---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Sprig from '../components/Sprig.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Process"
  description="How a Radiant Garden comes to life: an honest on-site consult, a personalized design you approve, a founder-led build, and support through your first harvest and beyond."
>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The process</p>
      <h1>From first walk-through to first harvest</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Four unhurried steps, and the founder handles every one of them
        personally. You'll always know exactly where your garden stands.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-paper">
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <span class="step-when">Step one · On your property</span>
            <h3>The consult</h3>
            <p>
              We walk your property together and talk — what you'd love to grow,
              how your family eats, and what your space allows. We'll look at
              sun, slope, water, and soil. You get honest advice first: if a
              garden isn't a good fit for your yard, we'll say so.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <span class="step-when">Step two · The plan</span>
            <h3>Design</h3>
            <p>
              The founder drafts a personalized garden design: bed layout,
              trellis and irrigation placement, and a planting plan tuned to the
              Finger Lakes season and your family's favorite meals. You review
              every detail and approve the plan before any building begins — no
              surprises.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <span class="step-when">Step three · One to two days on site</span>
            <h3>Build</h3>
            <p>
              The founder personally builds your garden — beds set level and
              square, quality soil delivered and prepared, irrigation and
              trellises installed and tested. Materials come directly to your
              site, and we leave the space tidy. When we're done, we walk the
              finished garden together and you sign off.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <span class="step-when">Step four · The seasons ahead</span>
            <h3>First harvest &amp; beyond</h3>
            <p>
              We plant the first season with you, show you how everything works,
              and set you up on the Digital Support Hub — planting calendar,
              reminders, photo diagnosis, and the client community. From there,
              the garden is yours; we're behind it for life.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Included with every garden</p>
        <h2>What you can count on</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          These aren't upgrades or add-ons — they're part of the way we work.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>A personalized design you approve before we build</li>
        <li>Founder-led installation — the person who designs your garden builds it</li>
        <li>First-season planting help and hands-on coaching</li>
        <li>The Digital Support Hub, free for the life of your garden</li>
        <li>Follow-up check-ins as you and your garden settle in</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">
        <a class="card-link" href="/services/">Explore the services in detail &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <Sprig />
      <h2>Step one starts with a hello</h2>
      <p>
        Radiant Gardens is in planning, with first consultations expected in
        2026. Reach out when you're ready — or now, just to dream a little.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Start the conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
